      prompt: `InvestMate Corp. purchased $300,000 in government bonds classified as available-for-sale on March 1, Year 1. On December 31, Year 1, the fair value of the bonds is $280,000. What should be the impact of the unrealized loss on InvestMate's financial statements at the end of Year 1?`,
